OL,3,ACivil servant faked illness with
OL,4,Amake-up to juggle five jobs, court
OL,5,Ahears
OL,6,
OL,7,FA civil servant is accused of earning
OL,8,Falmost #350,000 by juggling five
OL,9,Ffull-time public sector roles - using
OL,10,Fsick notes and working from home to
OL,11,Fcope with the workload.
OL,13,FKashim Chowdhury allegedly held
OL,14,Fmultiple government jobs between
OL,15,FFebruary 2020 and September 2023,
OL,16,Fearning #350,000 overall.
OL,18,FThe jury at Southwark Crown Court has
OL,19,Fbeen told he wore white make-up during
OL,20,Fa video call with his boss to try to
OL,21,Flook ill, but the make-up began peeling
OL,22,Foff his skin.
