OL,5,Ahears
OL,6,
OL,7,FChowdury, a 55-year-old from east
OL,8,FLondon, is on trial accused of nine
OL,9,Fcounts of fraud, which he denies. He
OL,10,Fdenies acting dishonestly or intending
OL,11,Fto make a dishonest gain.
